/-!
# The natural seven-point parabolic calculation

This interface retains the actual even-weight core, coordinate action and
dot-product form. Faithful normal extensions of its marked A₇ action embed
compatibly in S₇. A single perpendicular displacement has weight four; its
complementary even plane has pointwise fixer of two-rank at most two. The
literal point-stabilizer two-residual has three-rank two in either overgroup.
These calculations give the source transvection/rank contradiction.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript (1 March 2004), §B.3,
G.11.2(4), and Lemma 12.8.13(6), printed pp.856–857.
-/
